            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 11.01 The Purpose of this Section addresses methods and schedules to be applied when firms have not complied with the specified and timely reporting to trusts and depositories in other parts of this Agreement, i.e., NEBF, NEIF, Apprenticeship, Pension, Union dues, and LINECO.",
